":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 处由静止释放，小滑块撞击到“U”形盒 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 后立即被卡住（假设两者相互作用时间极短）。已知物体质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1} = m_{2} = m_{3} = 1.0 \\mathrm{~kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{4} = 3.0 \\mathrm{~kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小滑块与斜面间动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1} = 0.3"},{"type":"text","value":" ，与传送带间动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2} = 0.4"},{"type":"text","value":" ，挡板与圆筒内壁之间的滑动摩擦力大小恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"f = 60 \\mathrm{~N}"},{"type":"text","value":" （设最大静摩擦力与滑动摩擦力大小相等），不计空气阻力， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^{\\circ} = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos 37^{\\circ} = 0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" ，重力加速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n(1) 求小滑块刚滑到斜面底端 B 时的速度大小;\n（2）要使小球 E 能落下，求传送带运动的速度范围；\n（3）若小球 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 与挡板 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" 间的碰撞为完全弹性碰撞，求挡板 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" 下滑的最远距离。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5ed68a5e4ac8ae3cb79b9190de87fc8e01ab0f97140ff898fba799834dac7311.png","width":865,"height":456,"width_mm":101.64,"row_group":"zhuji-zhenduan-2412-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"第 18 题参考答案：（共 11 分）\n（1）设小滑块刚滑到底端 B 时的速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"m _ {1} g h _ {1} - \\mu_ {1} m _ {1} g \\cos \\theta \\cdot \\frac {h _ {1}}{\\sin \\theta} = \\frac {1}{2} m _ {1} v _ {0} ^ {2} - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {0} = 6 \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（2）设细绳张力为"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}=22N"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}=28N"},{"type":"text","value":"时对应速度分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"T _ {1} - \\left(m _ {1} + m _ {2}\\right) g = \\left(m _ {1} + m _ {2}\\right) \\frac {v _ {1} ^ {2}}{L _ {2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"T _ {2} - \\left(m _ {1} + m _ {2}\\right) g = \\left(m _ {1} + m _ {2}\\right) \\frac {v _ {2} ^ {2}}{L _ {2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {1} = 2 \\mathrm{m/s} \\quad v _ {2} = 4 \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"设小滑块与 “U” 形盒碰前对应速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由动量守恒定律"},{"type":"math","value":"m _ {1} v _ {3} = (m _ {1} + m _ {2}) v _ {1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"m _ {1} v _ {4} = (m _ {1} + m _ {2}) v _ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {3} = 4 \\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s} \\quad v _ {4} = 8 \\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n分析：设小滑块加速到"},{"type":"math","value":"8 \\, m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"的加速距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {4} ^ {2} - v _ {0} ^ {2} = 2 \\mu_ {2} g x _ {1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得:"},{"type":"math","value":"x _ {1} = 3. 5 \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"设小滑块减速到"},{"type":"math","value":"4 \\, m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"的加速距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {3} ^ {2} - v _ {0} ^ {2} = - 2 \\mu_ {2} g x _ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"x _ {2} = 2. 5 \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"因为传送带长"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}=4.0m"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以传送带需要顺时针转动，速度范围："},{"type":"math","value":"4 \\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s} \\leq v \\leq 8 \\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）设挡板 F 下滑的最远距离为 h，由于小球与挡板碰撞为弹性碰撞，由能量关系："},{"type":"math","value":"m _ {3} g (h _ {2} + h) + m _ {4} g h = f h"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）\n得:"},{"type":"math","value":"h = 2. 5 \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--zhuji-zhenduan-2412-q19","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--zhuji-zhenduan-2412","source_question_id":"zhuji-zhenduan-2412-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"37bbfd5266045c3f69fd33f9673ee613d244fc0c8506d7489f9173e454fee9e8","body":[{"type":"text","value":"19. （11分）高速公路上传统的避险车道是利用路边斜坡进行制动避险。某研究性学习小组基于电磁感应原理设计了由测速系统和制动系统组成的水平路面避险车道，如图甲所示。其工作原理如图乙所示：车厢底部装有励磁线圈（图中未画出）的汽车在进入避险车道时通过控制系统使线圈通电，可在边长为L的正方形虚线区域内产生竖直向下的匀强磁场；测速系统是一个长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、宽为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" （ "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}>L>L_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ）的固定矩形线圈；制动系统是在路面铺设一块足够大的金属板，金属板的厚度为d，电阻率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho"},{"type":"text","value":" ，为了研究方便，金属板中只考虑与正方形励磁线圈正对部分的磁场和电阻，其他部分的磁场和电阻均忽略不计。在某次模拟试验过程中，汽车刚到达测速线圈时，测速线圈产生的感应电流大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，已知汽车的总质量为M，励磁线圈产生匀强磁场的磁感应强度大小B，测速矩形线圈的电阻为R，不计汽车所受到的其他阻力，不考虑磁场运动产生的其它因素。\n(1) 汽车刚到达测速线圈时，\n① 求测速线圈产生的感应电流方向（从上往下看：选“顺时针”或“逆时针”）；\n② 求汽车速度的大小;\n(2) 求汽车通过测速线圈的过程中, 线圈受到安培力冲量的大小;\n(3) 若汽车刚到达金属板时的速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 求此后汽车在金属板上滑行的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e558e5f84c1e23aa706f6a3044c5ff7a7fd5cb600c5ffaddd1acd392ef51ef79.png","width":1214,"height":379,"width_mm":142.59,"row_group":"zhuji-zhenduan-2412-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第19题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"第 19 题参考答案：（共 11 分）\n(1) ① 测速线圈产生的感应电流方向：“逆时针”\n(1 分)\n② 设汽车速度的大小为 v，由法拉第电磁感应定律"},{"type":"math","value":"E = B L v"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {0} = \\frac {E}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac {I _ {0} R}{B L}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（2）设线圈受到安培力的冲量的大小为 I，则"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {A} = B \\bar {I} L \\cdot \\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\bar {I} = \\frac {B L \\bar {v}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {A} = \\frac {B ^ {2} L ^ {2}}{R} \\bar {v} \\cdot \\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {A} = \\frac {2 B ^ {2} L ^ {2} L _ {2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）在磁场进入金属板的过程中，设磁场进入长度为 x 时产生的电流为"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {1} = \\frac {E}{R} = \\frac {B L v}{\\rho \\frac {L}{x d}} = \\frac {B x d v}{\\rho}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n设磁场进入金属板的过程中，安培力冲量大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{\\mathrm{A1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {A 1} = \\sum B I _ {1} L \\cdot \\Delta t = \\sum \\frac {B ^ {2} L x d v}{\\rho} \\cdot \\Delta t = \\sum \\frac {B ^ {2} L x d}{\\rho} \\cdot \\Delta x"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {A 1} = \\frac {B ^ {2} d L ^ {3}}{2 \\rho}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n在磁场完全进入金属板后，设产生的电流为"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {2} = \\frac {E}{R} = \\frac {B L v}{\\rho \\frac {L}{L d}} = \\frac {B L d v}{\\rho}"},{"type":"text","value":"在磁场完全进入金属板后，设安培力冲量大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{\\mathrm{A2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {A 2} = \\sum B I _ {2} L \\cdot \\Delta t = \\sum \\frac {B ^ {2} L ^ {2} d v}{\\rho} \\cdot \\Delta t = \\sum \\frac {B ^ {2} L ^ {2} d}{\\rho} \\cdot \\Delta x"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {A 2} = \\frac {B ^ {2} L ^ {2} d}{\\rho} (x _ {0} - L)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n根据动量定理："},{"type":"math","value":"- I _ {A 1} - I _ {A 2} = M (0 - v _ {0})"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"x _ {0} = \\frac {M v _ {0} \\rho}{B ^ {2} L ^ {2} d} + \\frac {L}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--zhuji-zhenduan-2412-q20","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--zhuji-zhenduan-2412","source_question_id":"zhuji-zhenduan-2412-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"2be85a2d75327cc29eef0deef697dca6aa62a5576b7dd42dc337e334642d27d4","body":[{"type":"text","value":"20. （11分）电子束焊枪是利用“磁透镜”将电子束汇聚到工件上的装置，高速电子撞击工件使金属熔化实现焊接。简化原理如图甲所示，经加速后的电子束匀速通过速度选择器，以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 垂直“磁透镜”的左端面射入，“磁透镜”是长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、中心轴线为MN的圆柱体，其内分布着同心圆环磁场，磁场分布的截面图如图乙所示（从左向右看），它的磁感应强度的大小B与该点到中心轴线的垂直距离r成正比，即B=kr，其中k为常量。已知电子的质量为m、电量为e，速度选择器的两平行极板间距为d，匀强磁场的磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，不考虑电子间的相互作用。\n（1）求速度选择器两极板所加电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小；\n（2）由于电子通过圆柱体的时间极短，忽略电子束轴向（即沿中心轴线方向）速度的变化和径向（即垂直中心轴线方向）位移，\n① 求与中心轴线相距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的电子通过“磁透镜”径向动量的变化量；\n② 求电子束汇聚点到圆柱体右端面的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"f"},{"type":"text","value":" （即“磁透镜”的焦距）。\n(3) 调节速度选择器电压, 改变进入 “磁透镜” 电子的速度, 考虑电子径向位移, 使近轴电子束恰能汇聚到圆柱体的右端面和中心轴线的交点上, 求电子束的速度应满足什么条件? 忽略电子束轴向速度的变化。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6b8d9b3ab349868a1354aac19819c90686befe8b6e30c2ab040b205aa698b63d.png","width":835,"height":316,"width_mm":98.07,"row_group":"zhuji-zhenduan-2412-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图甲\n第20题图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/179404c15391d4049a22c45d49fcf9b59d87772924cfbcbe94d9b80875a39fe2.png","width":239,"height":239,"width_mm":27.93,"row_group":"zhuji-zhenduan-2412-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图乙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"第20题参考答案：（共11分）\n（1）电子束匀速通过速度选择器，则"},{"type":"math","value":"B _ {0} e v _ {0} = \\frac {U}{d} e"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得:"},{"type":"math","value":"U = B _ {0} d v _ {0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（2）由于忽略电子束轴向速度的变化，径向受恒力作用，由动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta P _ {r} = F _ {r} t"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta P _ {r} = B e v _ {0} \\frac {L _ {0}}{v _ {0}} = k r e L _ {0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n设电子径向速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"，电子会聚到焦点的时间为 t，如图所示，则"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {r} = \\frac {k r e L _ {0}}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac {r}{v _ {r}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/90f49adedf45a38aea6a1245cb77c6dbdec091d9ce042e473e05308a04ea74f4.png","width":492,"height":212,"width_mm":62.4},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"f = v _ {0} t = \\frac {m v _ {0}}{k e L _ {0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n另解：小量近似处理"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\theta = \\frac {L _ {0}}{R} = \\frac {L _ {0}}{\\frac {m v _ {0}}{k r e}}"},{"type":"math","value":"f = \\frac {r}{\\tan \\theta} = \\frac {r}{\\sin \\theta} = \\frac {m v _ {0}}{k e L _ {0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）不计电子束轴向速度的变化，设径向的力为"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"F _ {r} = k r e v"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n电子径向受力与 r 成正比，电子径向做简谐运动，设周期为 T，则"},{"type":"math","value":"T = 2 \\pi \\sqrt {\\frac {m}{k e v}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {L _ {0}}{v} = (2 n + 1) \\frac {T}{4} \\quad (n = 0, 1, 2 \\dots)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n则电子束的速度应该满足的条件为"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac {4 k e L _ {0} ^ {2}}{m \\pi^ {2} (2 n + 1) ^ {2}} \\quad (n = 0, 1, 2 \\dots)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}}]}
